# Public persona-pack recipes (PR-B W1, docs/PERSONA_PACKS_DESIGN.md §2).
#
# Each <persona_name>.yaml here is a *recipe*: it names a blend of real
# attributes, a weight, and an optional use_case. The actual injection block is
# rendered at install time from the named attributes (so attribute updates
# propagate automatically and the build_site.py-style drift gate is not
# required for packs).
#
# Initial 14 packs land in the same PR that introduces this directory; see
# docs/PERSONA_PACKS_DESIGN.md §6 for the canonical pack list.